{"4169100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GALAXY WARS Ⅱ", "steam_appid": 4169100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GALAXY WARS Ⅱ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grand strategy simulation meets intense fleet-based shooting action in the vastness of space.<br>The fate of the galaxy lies in your command.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Fusion of Strategy and Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the galactic map, command your fleets, capture enemy strongholds, and plan your next move strategically.<br>Once battle begins, the perspective shifts — take direct control of your fighters and engage in dynamic real-time dogfights.<br>Every decision and every maneuver can change the course of the war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Choose Your Allegiance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth Federation, Carmina Sector Directorate, Diaspora Compact, and Noah Helios Union —<br>Four unique factions with distinct technologies and philosophies.<br>Choose your side and fight for galactic supremacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Build Your Own Fleet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 types of warships and 49 types of fighters await your command.<br>Produce, refit, capture, and arrange them into your personal elite fleet.<br>Each ship and fighter is led by its own captain or pilot with unique abilities — assemble the ultimate fighting force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Tactical Combat with Terrain Advantage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use asteroid fields, nebulae, and spatial anomalies to outmaneuver your enemies.<br>Strike from the flanks or the rear to gain tactical superiority.<br>Deploy warp-capable space stations to surprise your foes with devastating ambushes.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GALAXY WARS Ⅱ</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grand strategy simulation meets intense fleet-based shooting action in the vastness of space.<br>The fate of the galaxy lies in your command.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Fusion of Strategy and Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the galactic map, command your fleets, capture enemy strongholds, and plan your next move strategically.<br>Once battle begins, the perspective shifts — take direct control of your fighters and engage in dynamic real-time dogfights.<br>Every decision and every maneuver can change the course of the war.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Choose Your Allegiance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth Federation, Carmina Sector Directorate, Diaspora Compact, and Noah Helios Union —<br>Four unique factions with distinct technologies and philosophies.<br>Choose your side and fight for galactic supremacy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Build Your Own Fleet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 types of warships and 49 types of fighters await your command.<br>Produce, refit, capture, and arrange them into your personal elite fleet.<br>Each ship and fighter is led by its own captain or pilot with unique abilities — assemble the ultimate fighting force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Tactical Combat with Terrain Advantage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use asteroid fields, nebulae, and spatial anomalies to outmaneuver your enemies.<br>Strike from the flanks or the rear to gain tactical superiority.<br>Deploy warp-capable space stations to surprise your foes with devastating ambushes.</p>", "short_description": "A new-style space war game that blends strategy simulation and shooting action. Command your fleet on the map and pilot your own fighter in battle. Combine 25 types of warships and 49 types of fighters freely, and build your ultimate fleet using production, capture, and formations.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169100/6d2ef6211cfc22095b